  "content": "<h1>ContingameIME</h1>\n<p>IngameIME 的非官方延續版。於全屏 Minecraft 中使用輸入法。</p>\n<h1>切換鍵</h1>\n<ul>\n<li>點擊熱鍵在<strong>臨時輸入狀態</strong>與<strong>關閉狀態</strong>之間切換</li>\n<li>雙擊熱鍵切換到<strong>開放模式</strong></li>\n<li><strong>臨時輸入狀態</strong>在鼠標移動且有內容提交時會切換到<strong>關閉狀態</strong></li>\n</ul>\n<h2>依賴項</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><p>Forge</p>\n<ul>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/kotlin-for-forge\" rel=\"nofollow\">Kotlin for Forge</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/cloth-config\" rel=\"nofollow\">Cloth Config API (Forge)</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/architectury-api\" rel=\"nofollow\">Architectury API (Forge)</a></li>\n</ul>\n</li>\n<li><p>Fabric</p>\n<ul>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/fabric-language-kotlin\" rel=\"nofollow\">Fabric Language Kotlin</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/cloth-config\" rel=\"nofollow\">Cloth Config API (Fabric)</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/architectury-api\" rel=\"nofollow\">Architectury API (Fabric)</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/satin-api\" rel=\"nofollow\">Satin API</a> <strong>(可選，與 Optifine 衝突)</strong></li>\n</ul>\n</li>\n</ul>\n<h3>本模組需要 VCRuntime141 才能運行，請從微軟官方網站下載<a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252flearn.microsoft.com%252fen-US%252fcpp%252fwindows%252flatest-supported-vc-redist\" rel=\"nofollow\">下載連結</a></h3>\n<h1>此模組程式碼參考/使用</h1>\n<ul>\n<li><a href=\"https://github.com/Windmill-City/IngameIME-Minecraft\" rel=\"nofollow\">Windmill-City/IngameIME-Minecraft</a> (LGPL-2.1)</li>\n<li><a href=\"https://github.com/Wybxc/IngameIME-Minecraft\" rel=\"nofollow\">Wybxc/IngameIME-Minecraft</a> (LGPL-2.1)</li>\n</ul>",
